zark-gnome-app (1.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Operations (A2): every action of the design runs one zark command
    through pkexec under its own polkit action, in an embedded terminal;
    Stop, Close and Quit during a run ask first; logout and suspend are
    inhibited while the app's run lasts. Depends on pkexec and
    gir1.2-vte-3.91.

